WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
I usually discover Korean skincare through short videos.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:08.600
But before I buy, I look for reviews that show the texture,
how it fits into a routine,

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.400
and whether it works for skin in humid weather.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.000
A celebrity might get my attention,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
but I still want to see the product used by someone
with skin concerns like mine.

